@startuml Kafka_Topic_Flow
title Kafka Topic Flow and Naming Alignment

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

component "admin-service" as Admin
component "engine-service" as Engine
component "report-service" as Report

package "shared-event expected topics" as SharedTopics {
  queue "test.execution.request" as ExpectedExecutionRequest
  queue "test.run.started" as ExpectedRunStarted
  queue "test.run.completed" as ExpectedRunCompleted
  queue "test.case.started" as ExpectedCaseStarted
  queue "test.case.completed" as ExpectedCaseCompleted
  queue "test.step.completed" as ExpectedStepCompleted
  queue "test.case.created" as TestCaseCreated
  queue "test.case.updated" as TestCaseUpdated
}

package "engine/report current topics" as CurrentTopics {
  queue "test-execution.requested" as CurrentExecutionRequested
  queue "test-execution.started" as CurrentExecutionStarted
  queue "test-step.completed" as CurrentStepCompleted
  queue "test-execution.completed" as CurrentExecutionCompleted
}

Admin --> ExpectedExecutionRequest : ExecutionRequestProducer\nKafkaTopic.TEST_EXECUTION_REQUEST
Admin --> TestCaseCreated : KafkaEventPublisher\ncreate lifecycle event
Admin --> TestCaseUpdated : KafkaEventPublisher\nupdate lifecycle event

CurrentExecutionRequested --> Engine : ExecutionConsumerVerticle\ndefault config fallback
Engine --> CurrentExecutionStarted : KafkaProducerManager\nEXECUTION_STARTED
Engine --> CurrentStepCompleted : KafkaProducerManager\nSTEP_COMPLETED
Engine --> CurrentExecutionCompleted : KafkaProducerManager\nEXECUTION_COMPLETED

CurrentExecutionStarted --> Report : KafkaConsumerService\ndefault topic list
CurrentStepCompleted --> Report : KafkaConsumerService\ndefault topic list
CurrentExecutionCompleted --> Report : KafkaConsumerService\ndefault topic list

ExpectedExecutionRequest -[#red,dashed]-> CurrentExecutionRequested : naming mismatch
ExpectedRunStarted -[#red,dashed]-> CurrentExecutionStarted : naming mismatch
ExpectedStepCompleted -[#red,dashed]-> CurrentStepCompleted : naming mismatch
ExpectedRunCompleted -[#red,dashed]-> CurrentExecutionCompleted : naming mismatch

note bottom
  Recommendation:
  Make shared-event KafkaTopic the single source of truth in all services,
  or configure every service to use the same names.
  Otherwise admin may publish to a topic the engine never consumes.
end note

@enduml
